WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.602
Hi! I have 3 apples and Mum gives me 4 more. How many altogether? Today we'll learn addition within 10.

2
00:00:10.752 --> 00:00:16.170
When we put two groups together, we add: 3 plus 4 equals 7.

3
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.842
When we have 5 and 2 more come, we add too.

4
00:00:19.992 --> 00:00:24.162
The + sign is plus and the = sign is equals.

5
00:00:24.312 --> 00:00:29.634
Questions with altogether or in all usually need adding.

6
00:00:29.784 --> 00:00:37.194
6 plus 3: count on 3 from 6: 7, 8, 9. It's 9.

7
00:00:37.344 --> 00:00:41.874
3 and 4 make 7, so 3 plus 4 equals 7.

8
00:00:42.024 --> 00:00:45.042
5 plus 0 is still 5.

9
00:00:45.192 --> 00:00:50.706
3 plus 4 and 4 plus 3 both equal 7.

10
00:00:50.856 --> 00:00:55.386
Watch out! When counting on, don't count the 6 again!

11
00:00:55.536 --> 00:01:00.258
Start from the number after 6: 7, 8, 9.

12
00:01:00.408 --> 00:01:04.770
So 6 plus 3 equals 9.

13
00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:12.594
Your turn! What is 2 plus 5? Pause and think.

14
00:01:12.744 --> 00:01:20.058
Count on 2 from 5: 6, 7. It's 7. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:28.050
Another one! What is 4 plus 4? Pause and think.

16
00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:33.330
4 and 4 make 8. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:41.586
Here's another! What is 7 plus 0? Pause and think.

18
00:01:41.736 --> 00:01:47.130
Adding 0 keeps it 7. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:55.458
Try one more! 3 plus what equals 10? Pause and think.

20
00:01:55.608 --> 00:02:00.786
3 and 7 make 10. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:00.936 --> 00:02:11.586
Try one more! There are 5 ducks and 3 more come. How many ducks altogether? Pause and think.

22
00:02:11.736 --> 00:02:18.810
More came, so add: 5 plus 3 is 8 ducks. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:26.898
Try one more! What is 1 plus 8? Pause and think.

24
00:02:27.048 --> 00:02:33.450
Swap to 8 plus 1 and count on one: 9. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:41.466
Last one! What is 6 plus 2? Pause and think.

26
00:02:41.616 --> 00:02:48.834
Count on 2 from 6: 7, 8. It's 8. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:48.984 --> 00:02:57.114
Remember: put together or add more means add. Count on from the bigger number, and adding 0 changes nothing.

28
00:02:57.264 --> 00:03:02.225
Make an addition story with your toys for your family!

